{"at": "2026-10-01T07:06:41.656279+00:00", "event_id": "01M3V4JTKRZTXEWW83D70SKP8H", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3V4BXG1EP7JX83TM5K6WSJ8", "final_answer": "Classify as PRIMARY: DECISION_LEDGER (DM-*.md + index.json) moves to the PRIMARY partition, matching where it is read and written today; decision events stay in the COORD status log; doctor joins the two through the seam; ADR amendment records the reversal of the #3928 intent.", "mission_id": "01M3V4BEWYPR3TP9N6A95A44KN", "mission_slug": "coord-artifact-single-home-01M3V4BE", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-01T07:06:41.656279Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3V4BXG1EP7JX83TM5K6WSJ8", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-01T07:06:41.648010Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-01T07:06:43.558678+00:00", "event_id": "01M3V4JWF657NZCVGAYNB11SP8", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3V4BZBQBA8RGHDJ7T3XSKCH", "final_answer": "Detect + guide, no auto-merge: doctor reports an already-forked log precisely, --repair never drops data, and the output tells the operator how to reconcile; automatic Lamport re-sequencing is out of scope (#4941).", "mission_id": "01M3V4BEWYPR3TP9N6A95A44KN", "mission_slug": "coord-artifact-single-home-01M3V4BE", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-01T07:06:43.558678Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3V4BZBQBA8RGHDJ7T3XSKCH", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-01T07:06:43.550193Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-01T07:20:09.042693+00:00", "event_id": "01M3V5BF2JT5DJ9Q22EJPRV42A", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M3V5BF2H898VQXB5MFTFHB1S", "input_key": "seed_mechanism", "mission_id": "01M3V4BEWYPR3TP9N6A95A44KN", "mission_slug": "coord-artifact-single-home-01M3V4BE", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "How does create seed the coordination surface?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-01T07:20:09.042693Z", "run_id": "01M3V5BF2H898VQXB5MFTFHB1S", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-01T07:20:09.041839Z", "step_id": "specify.design.seed-mechanism"}}
{"at": "2026-10-01T07:20:10.925060+00:00", "event_id": "01M3V5BGXDQR9K4JJXVYD63CRR", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3V5BF2H898VQXB5MFTFHB1S", "final_answer": "Eager materialization at create: the coordination worktree is added at create and the creation records are committed on the coordination branch through the existing coordination commit path. Direct ref commit rejected: leaves the Mission UNMATERIALIZED (reads raise under ADR 2026-09-24-2) and trips assert_coord_write_materialized.", "mission_id": "01M3V4BEWYPR3TP9N6A95A44KN", "mission_slug": "coord-artifact-single-home-01M3V4BE", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-01T07:20:10.925060Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3V5BF2H898VQXB5MFTFHB1S", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-01T07:20:10.917237Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
